<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="01">
<name>Engine</name>
<section id="10025_S000R" variety="S000R">
<name>Charging</name>
<ttl id="10025_S000R_744GY_T007J" variety="T007J">
<name>Charging (2AZ-FE)</name>
<para id="RM0000020XQ00EX" category="N" type-id="8009I" name-id="17106-00" from="200612">
<name>Function Inspection</name>
<subpara id="RM0000020XQ00EX_01" type-id="01" category="01">
<s-1 id="RM0000020XQ00EX_01_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___00003YW00000">
<ptxt>Inspect Battery Electrolyte Level</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Inspect Fluid Level</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>If it is below the LOW level, replace the battery or add distilled water.</ptxt>
</s3>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
<s-1 id="RM0000020XQ00EX_01_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___000036Q00000">
<ptxt>Inspect Battery Specific Gravity</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Inspect the battery specific gravity of each cell.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A001259" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Standard</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>1.25 to 1.29 (fluid temperature 20°C) </ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
<atten4>
<ptxt>If it is not within the standard, charge the battery.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
<s-1 id="RM0000020XQ00EX_01_0003" proc-id="RM0550J___00003YX00000">
<ptxt>Inspect Battery Voltage</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>To remove the surface charge, within 20 seconds after stopping the engine after driving, turn the ignition switch ON and turn ON the electrical systems (headlights, blower motor, rear defogger, etc.).</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Turn the ignition switch OFF and turn OFF the electrical systems.</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the battery voltage between the terminals.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A001260J06" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<spec>
<title>Standard</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>12.5 to 12.9V (fluid temperature 20°C) </ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
<atten4>
<ptxt>If it is not within the standard, charge the battery.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
<s-1 id="RM0000020XQ00EX_01_0004" proc-id="RM0550J___00003YY00000">
<ptxt>Inspect Battery Terminals, Fusible Link and Fuses</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Check that the battery terminals are not loose or corroded.</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Check the fusible links and fuses for continuity.</ptxt>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
<s-1 id="RM0000020XQ00EX_01_0005" proc-id="RM0550J___00003YZ00000">
<ptxt>Inspect Belt</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Inspect the belt for wear or cracks.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A088649" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Replace the belt if it is worn to the point where the core wire is visible.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Replace the belt if cracks reach the core wire (1 or more locations).</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Replace the belt if rib rubber is chipped (1 or more locations). </ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Check that the belt is securely engaged in the rib grooves.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A088652" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<atten4>
<ptxt>Check visually and by hand that the belt has not slipped out of the groove on the bottom of the pulley.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
<s-1 id="RM0000020XQ00EX_01_0006" proc-id="RM0550J___00003Z000000">
<ptxt>Inspect Alternator Wire Harness</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Inspect the wire harness for cracks or deterioration.</ptxt>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
<s-1 id="RM0000020XQ00EX_01_0007" proc-id="RM0550J___00003Z100000">
<ptxt>Inspect Alternator for Abnormal Noise</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Check that there is no abnormal noise from the alternator while the engine is running.</ptxt>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
<s-1 id="RM0000020XQ00EX_01_0008" proc-id="RM0550J___00003Z200000">
<ptxt>Inspect Charge Warning Light</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="3">
<s2>
<ptxt>Warm up the engine and turn the ignition switch OFF.</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Turn OFF all electrical system switches.</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Turn the ignition switch ON and check that the charge warning light comes on.</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Start the engine and check that the light goes off.</ptxt>
<atten4>
<ptxt>If the light does not operate as described above, troubleshoot the charge warning light circuit. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000005A200TX"/>)</ptxt>
</atten4>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
<s-1 id="RM0000020XQ00EX_01_0009" proc-id="RM0550J___00003Z300000">
<ptxt>No-load Test</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Charging Circuit Inspection</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00300</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A161614J01" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<s3>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester, AC/DC probe 400A), measure the battery voltage when the engine speed is raised to 2000r/min with no load.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Standard</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>12.1 to 15.4V (10A or less) </ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</s3>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
<s-1 id="RM0000020XQ00EX_01_0010" proc-id="RM0550J___00003Z400000">
<ptxt>Load Test</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00300</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<s2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester, AC/DC probe 400A), from the no-load test condition, turn the headlights to high beam and the heater blower switch to Hi, set the engine speed to 2000r/min, and measure the current.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A120553J03" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Standard</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>30A or more </ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
<atten4>
<ptxt>If the current is below the standard because the battery is fully charged, operate the wiper motor, rear window defogger, etc. to increase the load, and measure again.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
<s-1 id="RM0000020XQ00EX_01_0012" proc-id="RM0550J___00003Z500000">
<ptxt>Matrix by Problem Symptom</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>This troubleshooting is for determining whether the cause of the malfunction is on the alternator assembly side or on the alternator pulley with clutch side.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<s2>
<ptxt>Check Problem Symptom</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Identify the problem symptom and inspect according to the applicable chart.</ptxt>
<table>
<title>Check Result</title>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Symptom</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Charging malfunction (battery discharged, charge warning light on)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Go to step [*1]</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Belt abnormal noise / excessive slip</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Go to step [*2]</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Abnormal noise from alternator</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Go to step [*3]</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</s3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Alternator Pulley Lock Inspection [*1]</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>With the alternator installed on the vehicle, start the engine and visually check that the rotor (fan) inside the alternator is rotating.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Rotor rotates</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</s3>
<s3>
<ptxt>With the alternator removed, hold the rotor (fan) inside the alternator, turn the alternator pulley in the locking direction (clockwise), and check that it does not rotate.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Alternator pulley locks</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
<table>
<title>Check Result</title>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Inspection Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>OK</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Repair or replace alternator assembly</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>NG</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Replace alternator pulley with clutch</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</s3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>V-belt Wear Inspection [*2]</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Inspect the V-belt for wear.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>No wear or damage</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
<table>
<title>Check Result</title>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Inspection Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>OK</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Go to next step</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>NG</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Replace fan and alternator V-belt</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</s3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Alternator Pulley Wear Inspection</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Check that there is no abnormality in the groove shape of the alternator pulley.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>No wear or damage</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
<table>
<title>Check Result</title>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Inspection Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>OK</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Go to next step</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>NG</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Replace alternator pulley with clutch</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</s3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>One-way Clutch Function Operation Inspection</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>With the alternator removed, hold the rotor (fan) inside the alternator and check that the alternator pulley (outer race) rotates when turned in the free-running direction (counterclockwise).</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Alternator pulley (outer race) rotates</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
<table>
<title>Check Result</title>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Inspection Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>OK</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Go to next step</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>NG</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Replace alternator pulley with clutch</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</s3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Alternator Pulley Looseness Inspection</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Start the engine and inspect the alternator pulley installation area for looseness.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>No looseness</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
<table>
<title>Check Result</title>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Inspection Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>OK</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Inspect pulleys other than the alternator pulley</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>NG</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tighten the alternator pulley with clutch to the specified torque (111N*m{1127kgf*cm})</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</s3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Alternator Pulley Engagement Inspection [*3]</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>With the alternator removed, hold the rotor (fan) inside the alternator, and check that the alternator pulley locks when turned from the free-running direction (counterclockwise) to the locking direction (clockwise).</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Alternator pulley locks</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
<table>
<title>Check Result</title>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Inspection Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>OK</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Go to next step</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>NG</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Replace alternator pulley with clutch</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</s3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Sliding Noise Inspection During Free-running</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Perform a road test and check for abnormal noise during deceleration.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>No abnormal noise</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
<table>
<title>Check Result</title>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Inspection Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>OK</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Repair or replace alternator assembly</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>NG</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Replace alternator pulley with clutch</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</s3>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
</tmc-service-inc>